<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Rate band:</strong> 1.5% for low‑risk routes, up to 3% for high‑risk or premium‑value bikes. The typical rate for the Pune‑Varanasi corridor is around 2%.</span></li>
